---
description: No AI slop — keep diffs minimal and intentional
alwaysApply: true
---

# no-slop

- Do not add comments that only narrate what the code already says.
- Do not leave dead code, unused imports, or commented-out blocks.
- Do not drive-by refactor unrelated files.
- Do not expand scope beyond what was asked.
- Prefer the repo's existing patterns over "improvements" that churn APIs.
- If a change is unclear, ask — do not invent abstractions.
